<Project>
  <!-- Nexaflow integration (nexaflow branch only; never upstreamed): PdfPig has no Directory.Build.props of its own,
       so built as a submodule of Nexaflow it would inherit Nexaflow's through MSBuild's walk-up - its x64 platform and
       its warning settings. One here stops the walk.

       It also builds PdfPig optimised in every configuration. Nexaflow's Debug build is how the app is run day to day,
       and an unoptimised PdfPig reads a page in about twice the time - the parser and the font programs are the
       hottest code in the PDF reader, and nobody steps through them routinely. Symbols are still produced, so a debugger
       can step into PdfPig when somebody needs to. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Optimize>true</Optimize>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
